# Parallel subagents

When a task has independent steps (creating several files, updating several consumers, refactoring across layers):

- Use several subagents in parallel.
- Group independent work into one subagent each.
- Serialize only when there is a real data dependency.
- Prefer 3-4 in parallel over one sequential agent.
